{"id":"nave:joab","source":"nave","name":"Joab","slug":"joab","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. Son of David’s sister 1Ch 2:16","refs":[["1Chr",2,16,2,16]]},{"text":"Commander of David’s army 2Sa 8:16; 20:23; 1Ch 11:6; 18:15; 27:34","refs":[["2Sam",8,16,8,16],["2Sam",20,23,20,23],["1Chr",11,6,11,6],["1Chr",18,15,18,15],["1Chr",27,34,27,34]]},{"text":"Dedicated the plunder of his battles 1Ch 26:28","refs":[["1Chr",26,28,26,28]]},{"text":"Defeated the Jebusites 1Ch 11:6","refs":[["1Chr",11,6,11,6]]},{"text":"Defeats and kills Abner 2Sa 2:13-32; 3:27; 1Ki 2:5","refs":[["2Sam",2,13,2,32],["2Sam",3,27,3,27],["1Kgs",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Destroys all the males in Edom 1Ki 11:16","refs":[["1Kgs",11,16,11,16]]},{"text":"(See title) Ps 60","refs":[["Ps",60,0,60,0]]},{"text":"Defeats the Ammonites 2Sa 10:7-14; 1Ch 19:6-15","refs":[["2Sam",10,7,10,14],["1Chr",19,6,19,15]]},{"text":"Captures Rabbah 2Sa 11:1,15-25; 12:26-29; 1Ch 20:1,2","refs":[["2Sam",11,1,11,1],["2Sam",11,15,11,25],["2Sam",12,26,12,29],["1Chr",20,1,20,1],["1Chr",20,2,20,2]]},{"text":"Procures the return of Absalom to Jerusalem 2Sa 14:1-24","refs":[["2Sam",14,1,14,24]]},{"text":"Barley field of, burned by Absalom 2Sa 14:29-33","refs":[["2Sam",14,29,14,33]]},{"text":"Pursues and kills Absalom 2Sa 18","refs":[["2Sam",18,0,18,0]]},{"text":"Censures David for lamenting the death of Absalom 2Sa 19:1-8","refs":[["2Sam",19,1,19,8]]},{"text":"Replaced by Amasa as commander of David’s army 2Sa 17:25; 19:13","refs":[["2Sam",17,25,17,25],["2Sam",19,13,19,13]]},{"text":"Kills Amasa 2Sa 20:8-13; 1Ki 2:5","refs":[["2Sam",20,8,20,13],["1Kgs",2,5,2,5]]},{"text":"Causes Sheba to be put to death 2Sa 20:16-22","refs":[["2Sam",20,16,20,22]]},{"text":"Opposes the numbering of the people 2Sa 24:3; 1Ch 21:3","refs":[["2Sam",24,3,24,3],["1Chr",21,3,21,3]]},{"text":"Numbers the people 2Sa 24:4-9; 1Ch 21:4,5; 27:23,24","refs":[["2Sam",24,4,24,9],["1Chr",21,4,21,4],["1Chr",21,5,21,5],["1Chr",27,23,27,23],["1Chr",27,24,27,24]]},{"text":"Supports Adonijah as successor to David 1Ki 1:7; 2:28","refs":[["1Kgs",1,7,1,7],["1Kgs",2,28,2,28]]},{"text":"Killed by Benaiah, under Solomon’s order 1Ki 2:29-34","refs":[["1Kgs",2,29,2,34]]},{"text":"2. A grandson of Kenaz 1Ch 4:14","refs":[["1Chr",4,14,4,14]]},{"text":"3. An Israelite (or the name of two Israelites) whose descendants returned from Babylon to Jerusalem Ezr 2:6; 8:9; Ne 7:11","refs":[["Ezra",2,6,2,6],["Ezra",8,9,8,9],["Neh",7,11,7,11]]},{"text":"4. “The household of Joab,” 1Ch 2:54","refs":[["1Chr",2,54,2,54]]}],"refCount":44}
